.TH geectl-branch-set-link-rev 1  "geectl-branch-set-link-rev 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-branch\-set\-link\-rev \- Set the revision a link expands at. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl branch set\-link\-rev\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-project\fR> <\fB\-\-package\fR> <\fB\-\-revision\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the revision a link expands at. A mutation: dry\-run is the default
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR \fI<PROJECT>\fR
The project holding the package
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
The package whose link revision to set
.TP
\fB\-\-revision\fR \fI<REVISION>\fR
The revision: `latest`, `expanded`, `unset`, a bare revision (a number or an md5, expanded), or `pinned:<rev>` / `expanded:<rev>`
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
